{
  "id": "E411",
  "title": "Fried Chicken Bubble Tea",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-03-21",
  "synopsis": "Have you ever tried fried chicken flavored bubble tea?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50411/94c25ddc9442655649d47a65b867b094df005ed9.mp3?1584354122",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "炸鸡奶茶\n\n小乐：你去买东西吗？我要炸鸡，奶茶。\n保罗：什么？你要炸鸡味的奶茶？\n小乐：你想什么呢！我要炸鸡和奶茶，不是炸鸡味奶茶。\n保罗：那你为什么不说炸鸡和奶茶？\n小乐：因为方便啊。",
    "traditional": "炸雞奶茶\n\n小樂：你去買東西嗎？我要炸雞，奶茶。\n保羅：什麼？你要炸雞味的奶茶？\n小樂：你想什麼呢！我要炸雞和奶茶，不是炸雞味奶茶。\n保羅：那你為什麼不說炸雞和奶茶？\n小樂：因為方便啊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fried chicken bubble tea"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你去买东西吗？我要炸鸡，奶茶。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你去買東西嗎？我要炸雞，奶茶。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ qù mǎi dōng xi ma wǒ yào zhá jī nǎi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Are you going shopping? I want fried chicken, bubble tea."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：什么？你要炸鸡味的奶茶？",
      "traditional": "保羅：什麼？你要炸雞味的奶茶？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shén me nǐ yào zhá jī wèi de nǎi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What? You want fried chicken flavored bubble tea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：你想什么呢！我要炸鸡和奶茶，不是炸鸡味奶茶。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你想什麼呢！我要炸雞和奶茶，不是炸雞味奶茶。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ xiǎng shén me ne wǒ yào zhá jī hé nǎi chá bú shì zhá jī wèi nǎi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: What are you thinking! I want fried chicken and bubble tea, not fried chicken flavored bubble tea."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：那你为什么不说炸鸡和奶茶？",
      "traditional": "保羅：那你為什麼不說炸雞和奶茶？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà nǐ wèi shén me bù shuō zhá jī hé nǎi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then why didn’t you say fried chicken and bubble tea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：因为方便啊。",
      "traditional": "小樂：因為方便啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yīn wèi fāng biàn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Because it’s convenient."
    }
  ],
